B.ua=s([1,2,4,8,16,32,64,128,256,512,1024,2048,4096,8192,16384,32768,65536,131072,262144,524288,1048576,2097152,4194304,8388608,16777216,33554432,67108864,134217728,268435456,536870912,1073741824,2147483648],t.t)
B.PN=new A.hl("What is YT Master and how does it work?","YT Master is a community of creators who help each other grow. You earn coins by watching videos and subscribing to other members' channels, then spend those coins to run campaigns that bring real views and subscribers to your own channel. Every interaction comes from a real member of the community \u2014 never from bots.","Getting Started")
B.PQ=new A.hl("How do I earn coins?","Open Earn Coins to watch videos from active campaigns \u2014 when the timer completes, the reward is added to your balance automatically. You can also earn by subscribing to channels in Subscribe Channels, and by inviting friends with your referral code. Prefer a head start? You can top up instantly from Buy Coins.","Getting Started")
B.PK=new A.hl("Is it safe? Will my channel get banned?","All engagement on YT Master comes from real people choosing to watch or subscribe, which keeps your growth natural. We never ask for your YouTube password \u2014 you sign in with Google and we only ever need your public video links. Campaigns are also delivered gradually to reflect organic growth patterns.","Getting Started")
B.PP=new A.hl("How do I buy coins?","Go to Buy Coins, pick a package, and choose a payment method \u2014 bank transfer, Easypaisa, or JazzCash. Send the payment to the account shown, then submit the transfer details along with your transaction ID (TID). Your coins are credited as soon as the payment is verified.","Coins & Payments")
B.PL=new A.hl("How long does it take to receive coins after payment?","Most orders are verified and credited within a few hours. If your coins have not arrived within 24 hours of submitting your transaction details, contact support with your TID and order time so we can trace the payment quickly.","Coins & Payments")
B.PT=new A.hl("How do campaigns work?","Create Campaign lets you promote any of your videos. Choose a views package (with a minimum watch duration) or a subscribers package, paste your video link, and confirm. Your campaign becomes visible to the whole community, and you can follow its progress in real time from My Campaigns.","Campaigns")
B.PI=new A.hl("Can I run more than one campaign at a time?","Yes \u2014 you can have views and subscriber campaigns running simultaneously. For premium services we recommend completing one order per channel before starting the next, and avoiding overlapping orders from other providers so delivery can be tracked accurately.","Campaigns")
B.PR=new A.hl("What are the premium services?","Beyond the coin community, Our Services offers managed growth packages \u2014 YouTube watch time, views, and subscribers \u2014 tailored to your channel. Orders are arranged directly with our team over WhatsApp, so you can discuss your goals before committing.","Premium Services")
B.PJ=new A.hl("Why does watch time matter for monetization?","To join the YouTube Partner Program you need at least 4,000 public watch hours and 1,000 subscribers within the last 12 months. Watch time is also one of the strongest ranking signals in YouTube's algorithm, so growing it improves your reach as well as your monetization eligibility.","Premium Services")
B.PH=new A.hl("How fast are premium services delivered?","Typical delivery is one to three days depending on the size of the order. We intentionally deliver gradually (drip-feed) rather than all at once \u2014 it presents natural growth and protects your channel. You will receive a precise timeline when your order is confirmed.","Premium Services")
B.PM=new A.hl("What if my order drops or is not delivered?","Premium orders include a refill guarantee: if part of your delivered watch time or subscribers drops within 15 days, we replace it free of charge. If an order is not delivered within the estimated time, you are entitled to claim a refund.","Premium Services")
B.PO=new A.hl("What is the Channel's Market?","The Channel's Market lists established YouTube channels available for purchase, with subscriber counts, monetization status, and photos for each listing. When you find one you like, contact us through the listing and our team will walk you through a safe transfer.","Marketplace & Support")
B.PS=new A.hl("How do I contact support?","Our support team is available around the clock. Reach us on WhatsApp through any Buy Now button in Our Services, and include your order details or transaction ID when relevant \u2014 it helps us resolve your issue on the first reply.","Marketplace & Support")
